{"4675590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BOBA", "steam_appid": 4675590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game  was inspired by true events and adapted from actual childhood experiences. </strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/20753db66ee830f4b5c988ca5b42c1f3.poster.avif?t=1783226869\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/20753db66ee830f4b5c988ca5b42c1f3.webm?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/20753db66ee830f4b5c988ca5b42c1f3.mp4?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Do you like BOBA?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History tells us that the answer to this question can be found where the Elevator ends. </strong>  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/f210be5c038859e8dd635da9b20ae5e7.poster.avif?t=1783226869\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/f210be5c038859e8dd635da9b20ae5e7.webm?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/f210be5c038859e8dd635da9b20ae5e7.mp4?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore...</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the Elevator through each floor seeking a way to reach the End. Be wary of the dangers waiting for you as you travel through each labyrinth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/410afc931e1789f47b1e756109ede78d.poster.avif?t=1783226869\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/410afc931e1789f47b1e756109ede78d.webm?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/410afc931e1789f47b1e756109ede78d.mp4?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Main Features: </strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-Op:</strong> Don't face the dark alone! Bring up to <strong>4 friends</strong> to join you on the journey. That's 4 chances that<i> they</i> will be eaten instead of you! (To be clear it's a 5 player game!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOBA:</strong> Yes BOBA.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspenseful First-Person Exploration:</strong> Navigate claustrophobic, procedurally generated floors where every dark corner could hide the answer you're looking for. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying Entities: </strong>You'll definitely want a flashlight while exploring each floor so you don't go head to head with one of the abominations roaming the darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity:</strong> Monsters are not the only things that are out to get you. The Sanity System in BOBA is just as dangerous-if not worse-than any of the the creatures lurking within the darkness. Your own mind may be your End.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity-Based Voice Chat:</strong> Keep close to your friends to communicate, because sound doesn't travel far in the oppressive dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons:</strong> Weapons?! Yes, weapons. If you are lucky enough, maybe you'll find  firearms left behind by previous Researchers. They can be of great help to you and your friends as you push upwards. Just be careful, bullets hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/5a9693f3129379aaf34288e4f382b8ea.poster.avif?t=1783226869\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/5a9693f3129379aaf34288e4f382b8ea.webm?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/5a9693f3129379aaf34288e4f382b8ea.mp4?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring Friends. The Journey Is Grim.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misery loves company. So grab your friends! Up to <strong><u>four </u></strong>fellow BOBA Enthusiasts (or just regular friends) can take the plunge with you into the procedurally generated darkness via online co-op.(Again, 5 players total, including little ol' you) Survival depends on teamwork! Watch each other's backs, turn on a flashlight when the light grows thin, and coordinate your efforts to find your way to the next floor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/657cd82992a43498301173c0920b47a0.poster.avif?t=1783226869\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/657cd82992a43498301173c0920b47a0.webm?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/657cd82992a43498301173c0920b47a0.mp4?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When The Elevator Opens, Push Forward.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you like BOBA? </strong><i>The answer must be found.</i> Travel each floor looking for the exit, or any clues that can take you further toward the answer. (To put it simply: Run, try not to get eaten or lose your mind, and find the exit that takes you to the next floor.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utility:</strong> Find some flashlights and walkie-talkies hidden around each floor. They're a great asset in helping you navigate and communicate with your friends if you get lost or separated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons:</strong> Firearms can provide a major boost to your survivability... or they will be your demise. Ammo is a rare find and sometimes being loud is the fastest way to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cowardice Will Be Punished:</strong> Those who seek BOBA are not afraid. Those who are afraid will suffer. Be wary of your behaviors in game- as people who tend to chicken out are more likely to be tormented... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/23494fe452a76166687ce0ad83fbc984.poster.avif?t=1783226869\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/23494fe452a76166687ce0ad83fbc984.webm?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/23494fe452a76166687ce0ad83fbc984.mp4?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game  was inspired by true events and adapted from actual childhood experiences. </strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla