y: Run, try not to get eaten or lose your mind, and find the exit that takes you to the next floor.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utility:</strong> Find some flashlights and walkie-talkies hidden around each floor. They're a great asset in helping you navigate and communicate with your friends if you get lost or separated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons:</strong> Firearms can provide a major boost to your survivability... or they will be your demise. Ammo is a rare find and sometimes being loud is the fastest way to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cowardice Will Be Punished:</strong> Those who seek BOBA are not afraid. Those who are afraid will suffer. Be wary of your behaviors in game- as people who tend to chicken out are more likely to be tormented... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/23494fe452a76166687ce0ad83fbc984.poster.avif?t=1783226869\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/23494fe452a76166687ce0ad83fbc984.webm?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/extras/23494fe452a76166687ce0ad83fbc984.mp4?t=1783226869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "BOBA is a co-op FPS horror game inspired by true events. Journey through multiple floors, stopping at each one to solve puzzles that will allow you to continue the journey. The floors are always changing so you never know what to expect. Be careful! Those who ride the Elevator have never returned...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/168e748718dfb7936a60629c4c75331ed77103c6/header.jpg?t=1783226869", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/4d57344a20d44ac42ef0822f43f5da2f735af91d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783226869", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4675590/4d57344a20d44ac42ef0822f43f5da2f735af91d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783226869", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 or 12 compatible graphics card: NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD R9 380 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti, AMD Radeon RX 5700-XT, or better.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["OminousTruth"], "publishers": ["OminousTruth"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 48, "description": "LAN Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "scree